scription": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QJCsIRtrjgoQ7kNvwHYSt4c&_nc_oc=AdmvLrwpciHfqjtGXJK3N0Kfvieb2vw9fhCC6nbavhwhrU81gaB2F8f87B2FaLN6c9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsjBjKBXrzFIsuoUPFA85HITwnpg57oiMFQ8g-bmJKqtA&oe=69986789"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zEprSxFQdu8Q7kNvwGT9Hq7&_nc_oc=AdkmHvVkOSRkIsbOE2F-UE8sfjqXlGujUTremVf_NMAiU8BNl-qjIZsjfcT2Cl2X3XY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvDTtgHCaLfuWX4yj8k39hRz4NSQNpcm0yTbpXOkUTEOw&oe=699865BD"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031361_1498865310806544_8225324080290249197_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2LeCsBfU4z0Q7kNvwEoguXD&_nc_oc=Adk6EoiSyfprjP5JFFgubS2G7iDtqNDcRW0TN4NFHVMWgyH2e4iwDvvzP26n9nRP